    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Clip' Cliff",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A year ago, when you had just returned from Victoria, you immediately charged into the command center. If you'd been carrying a firearm, I would've thought you were mutinying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
