      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Clip' Cliff",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand your anger, but have you ever considered what would've happened if we hadn't evacuated as soon as possible? If a duke were to find out that Blacksteel, a Columbian company, was in the area?"
