      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Clip' Cliff",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And while you're at it, take this pouch. Give what's inside to a man from Davistown named Woodrow Bianchi."
